  "notes": [
    "Plant wind case P17_tendrils (Hanging tendrils) written by scripts/build_plants.py: Three 28870 curved stems hung by their bars in 61252 clips under an arch, and a 1997 curl. Parts picked by constant name from data/categories/parts; frame LDU, -Y up, the case front faces -Z, ground (base top) at y = 0. The wind blows toward +X.",
    "Joints: swing_1: real revolute about [0.0, 0.0, 1.0] through [-50.0, -110.0, -10.0] (real: 28870 bar (local y 0..10) in the 61252 clip; the curved stem hangs below the bar and swings about it); swing_2: real revolute about [0.0, 0.0, 1.0] through [-10.0, -110.0, -10.0] (real: 28870 bar (local y 0..10) in the 61252 clip; the curved stem hangs below the bar and swings about it); swing_3: real revolute about [0.0, 0.0, 1.0] through [30.0, -110.0, -10.0] (real: 28870 bar (local y 0..10) in the 61252 clip; the curved stem hangs below the bar and swings about it); twist_curl: real revolute about [0.0, -1.0, 0.0] through [-10.0, -116.0, 30.0] (real: 1997 bar (local y -8..0) in the 60897 vertical clip; the curl hangs along its bar, so the clip only lets it turn about the bar).",
